Mango-Flavored Minimal Config.

Ingredients.
1 cup ripened version cordial "get version"
2 tablespoons border pectin "setoption borderpx 0"
4 teaspoons gap juice "setoption gappih 4"
27 grams root color reduction "setoption rootcolor 1d1d2b"
1 pinch no-animation powder "setoption animations off"
1 splash alt-enter glaze "setoption bind alt,Return,spawn_shell,foot"
1 splash layout glaze "dispatch setlayout,tile"
3 dashes binding zest "get binds"
5 grams all-clients fondant "watch all-clients"

Method.
Put the ripened version cordial into the mixing bowl.
Simmer until glossy.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.
Serve with a drizzle of mango syrup.

Clean the baking dish.
Put the border pectin into the mixing bowl.
Fold until the caustic runs clear.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.
Serve with a whisper of lime.

Clean the baking dish.
Put the gap juice into the mixing bowl.
Stir briskly, eight times.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.
Serve with weeping whey.

Clean the baking dish.
Put the root color reduction into the mixing bowl.
Macerate until depressed.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.
Serve with a fan of bitterness.

Clean the baking dish.
Put the no-animation powder into the mixing bowl.
Whip to a restrained foam.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.
Serve matte, without garnish.

Clean the baking dish.
Put the alt-enter glaze into the mixing bowl.
Knead until the return snaps into place.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.
Serve with a ready shell.

Clean the baking dish.
Put the layout glaze into the mixing bowl.
Let rest in a square pan.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.
Serve in a tidy grid.

Clean the baking dish.
Put the binding zest into the mixing bowl.
Season lightly and don't argue.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.
Serve with quiet satisfaction.

Clean the baking dish.
Put the all-clients fondant into the mixing bowl.
Liquefy, then refrigerate together.
Pour contents of the mixing bowl into the baking dish.
Serve warm and attentive.

Serves 1.